<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan MFIG to tender 54,000 tonnes of U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan MFIG to tender 54,000 tonnes of U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group would tender on Thursday for 54,000 tonnes of No. 2 U.S. corn, local traders said.</p>
<p>The shipment would be scheduled for delivery for August 6-20 shipment from U.S. Gulf or August 21 to September 5 from the Pacific Northwest, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender was scheduled for 0700 GMT, with results to be announced at around 0900 GMT, they said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (2-508-0815)</p>
</text>
